@startuml session-event-lifecycle
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
hide empty description
[*] --> InView : appendEvent
InView --> Covered : a boundary is appended\nthat does not name it
InView --> [*] : the session is deleted or expired
Covered --> [*] : the session is deleted or expired
InView : sent to the model (EventFilter.active)
Covered : kept in the log (EventFilter.all),\nnot sent to the model
@enduml
